Both are needed because AuthService creates donor/hospital profiles during registration. Without them Laravel will throw an error.
Create app/Models/DonorProfile.php and app/Models/HospitalProfile.php — the code for both is in HASIB_TASKS.md in the repo root.
Step 3 — Test using Postman
Test these 4 endpoints:

POST /api/register — with name, email, password, role, and role specific fields
POST /api/login — with email and password, returns token
GET /api/me — send token in Authorization header
POST /api/logout — send token in Authorization header



